      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HERE COMES BILLY (3) has a strong record this trip with 14 wins and eight placings from 23 starts. Scored by a neck last time (23.63) in a Free For All over 425m at Bendigo. Rates on top and should go close. DR. ZAIDEN (1) got the job done again after running them ragged to make it two on end at Traralgon over 425m (23.80). Goes very well from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from six starts. In top form and looks a key chance again. DR. TESSA (8) was beaten for speed from wide out but attacked the line strongly to place, 3 lengths from the winner (24.70) at this track in Grade 4/5. Expected to feature. JOEY (7) is a last-start placegetter worth considering.",
